<title>INDIA: India's RBI accepts bids for 40 bln rupees at repo.</title>
<headline>India's RBI accepts bids for 40 bln rupees at repo.</headline>
<dateline>BOMBAY 1997-07-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Reserve Bank of India (RBI) said on Friday it accepted bids for 40 billion rupees at its repo auction of government securities.</p>
<p>The RBI said it received three bids for 40 billion rupees and accepted all of them.</p>
<p>The cut-off rate was 3.95 percent and the weighted-average cut-off, 3.92821 pct, the RBI said.</p>
<p>-- Bombay newsroom +91-22-265 9000</p>
</text>
